  "description": "<div style=\"font-family:Poppins;\"><div><p>LelyBely<span style=\"color:rgb(71,71,71);font-family:Arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;float:none;\">™</span> creates high-quality, safe, and beautifully designed <strong>indoor and outdoor play products</strong> that help kids develop balance, coordination, and confidence through play.<br>Our hero product — the <strong>Non-Slip Stepping Stones Set</strong> — is loved by parents and kids alike for turning any living room or backyard into a fun obstacle course that builds <strong>gross motor skills</strong>, <strong>balance</strong>, and <strong>active imagination</strong>.<br>Each product is non-toxic, kid-safe, and designed with both <strong>fun and development</strong> in mind.</p><hr><h3><strong><span style=\"color:rgb(235,107,86);\">What makes us different</span></strong></h3><p>Most kids’ toys are short-lived distractions. LelyBely<span style=\"color:rgb(71,71,71);font-family:Arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;float:none;\">™</span> focuses on <strong>purposeful play</strong> — helping children move, learn, and grow while having fun.<br>We stand out with:</p><ul><li><p><strong>Premium quality materials</strong> (tested, durable, non-slip).</p></li><li><p><strong>Stylish minimalist design</strong> that fits any home.</p></li><li><p><strong>Multi-age appeal</strong> (toddlers to 7-year-olds).</p></li><li><p><strong>5-star parent reviews</strong> praising both fun and developmental value.</p></li><li><p>A brand built around <strong>movement, creativity, and connection</strong>, not screens.</p></li></ul><hr><h3><strong><span style=\"color:rgb(235,107,86);\">How affiliates can earn</span></strong></h3><p>Affiliates earn a <strong>20% commission</strong> on every sale they generate — one of the highest in the kids’ toy industry.<br>Our average order value (AOV) is <strong>$50–$70</strong>, and many customers buy multiple sets for friends and family — meaning your commissions can scale fast.<br>Payments are made <strong>automatically through UpPromote</strong> with transparent tracking and performance analytics.</p><hr><h3><strong><span style=\"color:rgb(235,107,86);\">How to promote us</span></strong></h3><p>You can promote LelyBely<span style=\"color:rgb(71,71,71);font-family:Arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;float:none;\">™</span> through:</p><ul><li><p>Blog articles or reviews about kids’ play, parenting, or Montessori development.</p></li><li><p>Instagram, TikTok, or Facebook Reels showing kids playing or demonstrating balance challenges.</p></li><li><p>Pinterest boards or posts about playroom ideas or indoor activities.</p></li><li><p>Email newsletters to parent or educator audiences.</p></li><li><p>YouTube videos focused on kids’ development or toy recommendations.</p></li></ul><p>We provide affiliates with <strong>ready-to-use creatives, photos, and videos</strong>, as well as special promo codes for your audience to boost conversions.</p><hr><h3><strong><span style=\"color:rgb(235,107,86);\">Other information</span></strong></h3><p>We’re growing fast and actively investing in affiliate partners who can bring genuine value to the table.<br>Expect <strong>high conversion rates</strong>, strong retention, and a trusted brand that parents love.<br>For any custom collaboration, bundle deals, or influencer opportunities — contact us directly at <strong><a class=\"decorated-link cursor-pointer\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">support@lelybely.com</a></strong>.</p><p>Join us!</p></div></div>",
